        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Welcome to Trivia Monsters, a trivia based VR battle game where players battle their monsters against others. In Trivia Monsters, players unleash a roster of up to 12 unique monsters, each with its own distinctive mini-games and trivia categories. These monsters are no ordinary creatures—they’re equipped with questions that span a wide range of categories: math, movies, food, science, history, music, pop culture, and beyond, ensuring a mix of trivia for every player.\n\nThe key to victory lies in the speed and accuracy of your trivia responses. Complete your monster’s trivia-based mini-game faster than your opponent to unleash powerful attacks and gain the upper hand. With every battle, players not only engage in brain-teasing fun but also explore the strengths of each monster, building strategies and sharpening their wits.\n\nWhich monster are you taking to battle?",
